WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:07.520
Another thing Dr. Bright is not allowed to do at&nbsp;
the Foundation: Dr. Bright! You can't eat SCP-682!

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:11.840
Just because SCP-682 regenerates&nbsp;
any tissue it loses does not mean&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:11.840 --> 00:00:16.000
it is the solution to the worldwide food&nbsp;
crisis, and it definitely doesn't mean&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:16.000 --> 00:00:20.720
that the hard-to-kill reptile is some kind&nbsp;
of, quote, "Infinite hamburgers machine."

00:00:20.720 --> 00:00:25.040
Not only is the meat from 682 probably&nbsp;
not safe for human consumption,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:25.040 --> 00:00:29.600
but when Dr. Bright brought his own&nbsp;
special burgers to the Foundation barbecue,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:29.600 --> 00:00:32.800
they tasted horrible and&nbsp;
gave everyone food poisoning.

00:00:32.800 --> 00:00:40.080
SCP-682 is not "the new white meat,"&nbsp;
or the new any kind of meat. Stop it.

